## Sorts of Invariants
- Datastructure

> Binary Tree: The height of the left and right tree for any node does not differ by more than 1.

- Control Flow 

> ```
> if condition {
>     return thing
> }
> // !condition must hold
> ```

## Steps To Be a Better Programmer

- Identifying actual/potential invariants in code and datastructures
- Enforcing invariants



